## Allowed without asking

- Read / inspect checkpoints (`torch.load` map_location cpu).
- Write **new** run dirs with a **new** name.
- Edit code the user asked to change.
- Move superseded runs into `runs/old/` **only when the user asks**, and only after confirming the destination does not erase a newer checkpoint.

## If unsure

Stop. Report what you were about to overwrite and wait for an explicit yes.
